"t": "num",
"q": "A wave with ω = 10⁸ rad/s propagates in a medium with ε_r = 1, μ_r = 20 and σ = 3 S/m (a good conductor since σ/ωε ≈ 3400). Find the attenuation constant α in Np/m.",
